From 6f5da3b052f5187d81fc4fdb4a7c2ea5f293c6e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:39:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Recent Requests history + Check Status button to
 Validation and IPE Clearance

- Both pages used VerificationHistoryView (SUCCESS-only, no check button, 7-day window),
  unlike Personalization/BVN Retrieval which already have a full ticket table with a
  per-row 'Check' button. Validation and IPE Clearance now use the same pattern.
- New shared TicketTrackingTable component (components/verification/shared.tsx),
  extracted from PersonalizationPage's table so it isn't duplicated a third/fourth time.
- GET /verification/tickets now accepts a comma-separated list of service keys, not just
  one - Validation has four separate service keys (one per detail type) and shows all of
  them combined in one table, labeled per-row via a new  field on each ticket.
- Layout/containers (Service Type tiles, Slip Type tiles, Supply ID/Tracking ID) are
  untouched, per instruction to leave those as they are.
- tests: 3 new (221 total)
